WHAT THIS IS
------------
Six verification Checks, written as prose skills for agent harnesses that read the
Agent Skills standard:

  adversarial-pass       argue the opposite using only the document's own evidence
  attested-deliverable   produce or retrofit a deliverable that carries its evidence
  claim-to-source        trace every load-bearing claim back to a source
  off-script-check       ask what the document was not written to answer
  prediction-log         stake a dated, falsifiable prediction and score it later
  specificity-check      separate constrained claims from unconstrained ones

Each Check runs standalone. None requires the others, a corpus, a panel, or any part
of the system it came from.

