PROVENANCE
----------
The Checks in this Kit are generated from the author's master copy and are not
hand-edited in the distributed tree. A `.generated` marker in the built plugin records
that provenance. Report issues in this repository; fixes are made at the source
and the Checks regenerated.

CREDIT
------
Four of the Checks (claim-to-source, off-script-check, adversarial-pass and
specificity-check) operationalise the four explanation-quality checks Rafael Kaufmann
proposed (Primordia, 2026). He is a cited source, not a co-author. The procedures,
verdicts and tags are the author's.

Credit to Rajiv Pant (Synthesis Engineering, https://synthesiswork.org/) for the
